- [x] ✅ \`EURC\` — issuer \`GA5Z…KZVN\` — trustline exists
- [ ] ❌ \`FOO\` — issuer \`GA5Z…KZVN\` — trustline missing
- [ ] ❌ \`BAR\` — issuer \`GA5Z…KZVN\` — trustline missing — [remediation](https://stellar.expert/explorer/public/asset/BAR)"

exports[`buildAssetTrustlineTable truncation (Issue #860) matches the golden snapshot for a truncated table 1`] = `
